        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Enhance existing software applications - We continue to invest in the development and enhancement of our Spok Care Connect suite of products and services, at a similar rate consistent to the prior year.",
